                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "\n🌑✨ \n\nI honestly don’t even like games… but this one isn’t a game  it’s a movie you shape yourself.  \nA story where every choice you make carries real consequences, real outcomes, real weight.\n\nThis isn’t just a game.  \nIt’s me choosing who I am.\n\nThe main story is simple yet powerful:  \nWill I become a Deviant,  \nor become exactly what Amanda wants me to be?\n\nAfter learning certain truths, will you change who you are?  \nOr will you remain the person you were at the beginning?\n\nWill you sacrifice?  \nOr will you stay proud and unbending?\n\nDetroit: Become Human is a journey of love, sacrifice, anger, confusion, and epic moments —  \na story where every decision becomes a heartbeat.\n\nThe music, the visuals, the atmosphere…  \nEverything is simply on another level.\n\n",
